# Optional overrides. The game runs without any of these.
#
# The global leaderboard is on by default: the client probes /api/leaderboard and
# falls back to the on-device Hall of Fame when no durable store is configured.
# Force local-only mode (and zero leaderboard network calls) with:
# VITE_LEADERBOARD_API=false
#
# Send optional gameplay telemetry to an endpoint you own:
# VITE_ANALYTICS_URL=https://example.com/api/analytics
#
# Server-side storage for the shared board (set these in the hosting project,
# never in the client bundle): LEADERBOARD_KV_REST_URL / LEADERBOARD_KV_REST_TOKEN,
# or KV_REST_API_URL / KV_REST_API_TOKEN,
# or UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL / UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN.
